# Build context is the repo root (see apps/context-service/Dockerfile): the image needs
# apps/context-service and etynt_gui. Everything else is either rebuilt in an image layer
# or supplied at runtime by a bind mount, so it stays out of the context.
.git
.githooks
**/node_modules
**/dist
# The UI build stage falls back to this artefact when the npm registry is unreachable
# (see the Dockerfile); `make ui-build` regenerates it.
!etynt_gui/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
# Mounted at /repo and /data by compose, never copied into the image.
vendor
data
docs
infra
scripts
AGENTS.md
README.md
LICENSE
